# Z/pZ is a field for a prime p: cancellation (no zero divisors), and
# a^(p-1) == 1, a a^(p-2) == 1 (mod p) for a not divisible by p (Fermat);
# the last is the inverse of the specification: FS.minv(p, a) = a^(p-2) mod p.
# "p does not divide a" is {Nat.is_eq(Nat.mod(a, p), 0n) == False{}}.

